+    // Paper, Sec. 2.1: a segment is valid while some line stays within +-eps of every point. Here the set of such
+    // lines is kept explicitly as a convex polygon in (slope, intercept) space, clipped by two half-planes per point.
+    struct Line { long double a, b; }; // slope, intercept at first_x relative to first_y
